# Adapt to your actual authenticated broker user names.
user fridge_a
 topic write coldchain/telemetry/FRIDGE_A
 topic read coldchain/ack/FRIDGE_A
 topic read coldchain/cmd/FRIDGE_A
user fridge_b
 topic write coldchain/telemetry/FRIDGE_B
 topic read coldchain/ack/FRIDGE_B
 topic read coldchain/cmd/FRIDGE_B
user backend
 topic read coldchain/telemetry/+
 topic write coldchain/ack/+
 topic write coldchain/cmd/+
